graph LR
    classDef azure fill:#0078D4,stroke:#005A9E,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff,rx:5px,ry:5px
    classDef unmanaged fill:#EBEBEB,stroke:#CCC,stroke-width:2px,color:#333,rx:5px,ry:5px

    subgraph Service [Azure Foundry Agent Service]
        direction TB
        L[Agent Logic Python/C#]:::unmanaged
        SK[Semantic Kernel]:::unmanaged
        Mem[Memory & Tools]:::unmanaged
    end

    subgraph Gateway [AI Gateway Layer]
        direction TB
        GW[fa:fa-cloud Azure API Management]:::azure
        RL[Rate Limiting & Throttling]:::unmanaged
        Cache[Redis Caching]:::unmanaged
        Sec[Auth / Entra ID]:::azure
        Mon[Usage Monitoring]:::azure
    end

    subgraph Backends [Model Deployments]
        direction TB
        OAI[fa:fa-brain Azure OpenAI GPT-4]:::azure
        L3[Llama 3]:::unmanaged
        D3[DALL-E 3]:::azure
    end

    Service --> |Service Endpoint| Gateway
    Gateway ==> |Secure Connections| Backends
